{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46245","headline":"送郑侍郎骞赴阙 · 贯休","name":"送郑侍郎骞赴阙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"文章国器尽琅玕，朝骑駸駸岁欲残。\n彩笔祗宜天上用，绣衣偏称雪中看。\n休惊断鴈离三楚，渐入祥烟下七盘。\n翰苑旧知凭与说，紫金轮畔寄书难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46245.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46245","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}